        "message": {
          "content": "{\n  \"insertions\": [\n    {\n      \"after_anchor\": \"这种异质性源于人群特异性特征、样本处理方法学差异以及饮食和药物使用的混杂 [P0478][P0565]。\",\n      \"text\": \"此外，肠型（Enterotype）分层分析显示，不同肠型患者对 ICI 的响应标志物存在显著差异（如 E2 肠型中*Collinsella*为阳性标志物，而 E1 肠型中*Bacteroides*为阳性标志物），进一步解释了跨队列生物标志物难以统一的原因 [P0170]。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"after_anchor\": \"PPI 使用同样与 ICI 疗效降低相关（OS HR=1.28, 95% CI 1.17-1.41）[P0339]。\",\n      \"text\": \"另一项涵盖 22,568 名患者的荟萃分析也报告了相似的效应量（OS HR=1.28）[P0081]。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"after_anchor\": \"目前尚无 completed large-scale Phase III RCT 证实微生物干预在 ICI 治疗中的普遍获益，证据等级仍停留在假设生成与早期验证阶段 [P0333][P0578]。\",\n      \"text\": \"需注意的是，FMT-LUMINate 试验中黑色素瘤队列的 3 级及以上治疗相关不良事件发生率为 60%（12/20），其中腹泻或结肠炎占 20%，心肌炎发生率为 15%，提示双免疫检查点抑制背景下的安全性信号需密切关注 [P0583]。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"complete\": true,\n  \"remaining_content\": []\n}",
          "reasoning_content": "Thinking Process:\n\n1.  **Analyze the Request:**\n    *   **Task:** Complete Chapter 1 (Ch1) of the manuscript based on the provided `chapter_assignment`, `draft_body_markdown`, `remaining_content`, `manuscript_guide`, and `materials`.\n    *   **Goal:** Fill the gaps (`remaining_content`) in the draft while preserving the original text (`draft_body_markdown`).\n    *   **Constraints:**\n        *   Retain original draft text.\n        *   Add concise explanations, comparisons, or tables to fill gaps.\n        *   Follow the `manuscript_guide` structure (Clinical Association Evidence -> Immune Mechanism -> Metabolite Mediator -> External Interference -> Active Intervention -> Toxicity Management -> Methodology & Translation Boundaries). Ch1 focuses on Clinical Association Evidence.\n        *   Verify sources (objects, groups, conditions, time anchors, numerical denominators, result directions) against `materials`.\n        *   Use exact source handles (e.g., [P####]) for citations.\n        *   Handle source aliases (e.g., P0333=P0584, P0402=P0576, P0049=P0605).\n        *   Do not count引言 (Introduction) towards the 150 citation limit yet.\n        *   Ensure conclusion strength matches evidence (observational vs. causal, animal vs. human, etc.).\n        *   Output format: JSON with `insertions` (after_anchor, text) and `complete` (true/false), `remaining_content`.\n    *   **Specific Ch1 Requirements:**\n        *   Establish \"signal but no universal biomarker\".\n        *   Explain non-generalizability (cohort heterogeneity, regimen modification, external drugs, longitudinal dynamics).\n        *   Include Evidence Ladder Table (FMT-LUMINate, MIMic, MITRIC, etc.).\n        *   Keep specific counterexamples (mCRPC Akkermansia negative, SCRUM-Japan alpha diversity null, oral bacteria/PPI interaction).\n        *   Keep regimen specificity (JCOG2007 NIC vs PC).\n        *   Keep antibiotic/PPI effect sizes and time windows (detail